WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:02.535
This Court. Mar a Lago in court.

00:00:02.535 --> 00:00:05.038
Trump advisers very much by surprise.

00:00:05.038 --> 00:00:07.040
They had been believing the idea

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:08.808
that the grand jury was out for a month,

00:00:08.808 --> 00:00:10.510
which was widely reported

00:00:10.510 --> 00:00:11.011
You know, it was

00:00:11.011 --> 00:00:13.246
it was not entirely clear

00:00:13.346 --> 00:00:14.614
whether that was going to be the case.

00:00:14.614 --> 00:00:15.415
And as it turns out,

00:00:15.415 --> 00:00:17.684
it was not based on our reporting.

00:00:18.284 --> 00:00:20.320
You know, they are in something of shock.

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:21.121
I think they will move

00:00:21.121 --> 00:00:22.355
past that fairly quickly.

00:00:22.355 --> 00:00:23.790
I think you will see

00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:26.259
Trump get very aggressive about Bragg.

00:00:26.259 --> 00:00:26.960
We don't know

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:28.695
exactly what the charges are yet.

00:00:28.695 --> 00:00:29.162
So that

00:00:29.162 --> 00:00:31.398
has an element of uncertainty to it.

00:00:32.065 --> 00:00:33.233
But this is not a moment

00:00:33.233 --> 00:00:34.334
Donald Trump wanted.

00:00:34.334 --> 00:00:35.035
It's an appointment

00:00:35.035 --> 00:00:35.702
in a moment

00:00:35.702 --> 00:00:37.570
that he's been avoiding for many, many,

00:00:37.570 --> 00:00:38.538
many decades.

00:00:38.538 --> 00:00:39.806
Is being indicted criminally.

00:00:39.806 --> 00:00:41.941
It may help him politically, Wolf.

00:00:41.941 --> 00:00:43.143
There are reasons to believe

00:00:43.143 --> 00:00:44.277
this case in particular

00:00:44.277 --> 00:00:46.179
could with his base.

00:00:46.179 --> 00:00:47.781
But nobody wants an indictment.

00:00:47.781 --> 00:00:49.249
And Donald Trump is not an exception

00:00:49.249 --> 00:00:50.750
and now this sets in motion

00:00:50.750 --> 00:00:52.352
a series of actions.

00:00:52.352 --> 00:00:54.387
Yeah, you're absolutely right, Maggie.

00:00:54.654 --> 00:00:57.023
And no one wants to be criminally charged

00:00:57.223 --> 00:00:58.291
with an indictment.

00:00:58.291 --> 00:00:59.759
And now the former president,

00:00:59.759 --> 00:01:00.794
United States,

00:01:00.794 --> 00:01:02.195
is about to be criminally charged

00:01:02.195 --> 00:01:03.329
with an indictment.

00:01:03.329 --> 00:01:05.465
Durham Eyes and you're our legal analyst.

00:01:05.598 --> 00:01:06.599
Walk us through

00:01:06.599 --> 00:01:08.034
what Trump should now expect

00:01:10.203 --> 00:01:11.838
Well, Wolf,

00:01:11.838 --> 00:01:12.439
Trump will

00:01:12.439 --> 00:01:13.873
now need to

00:01:13.873 --> 00:01:15.675
will receive the indictment

00:01:15.675 --> 00:01:17.677
and he will need to decide

00:01:17.677 --> 00:01:20.313
if he is going to show up and plead,

00:01:20.313 --> 00:01:22.248
as almost every defendant does

00:01:22.248 --> 00:01:23.450
or if he's going to fight it.

00:01:23.450 --> 00:01:24.484
You've heard the reporting

00:01:24.484 --> 00:01:26.019
that he will show up.

00:01:26.019 --> 00:01:28.321
But, Wolf, what he should speak

00:01:28.321 --> 00:01:30.690
expect is the treatment

00:01:31.324 --> 00:01:32.826
that any defendant gets

00:01:32.826 --> 00:01:35.195
when they're accused of a serious crime.

00:01:35.228 --> 00:01:37.597
And all indications here are that

00:01:37.997 --> 00:01:40.366
this is no mere salacious

00:01:40.366 --> 00:01:41.434
hush money account.

00:01:41.434 --> 00:01:43.403
This is allegations

00:01:43.403 --> 00:01:45.572
of keeping false books and records

00:01:45.572 --> 00:01:48.808
in order to conceal a campaign financed.

00:01:49.776 --> 00:01:53.146
These payments were done in part

00:01:53.146 --> 00:01:55.215
at least, to aid the campaign.

00:01:55.215 --> 00:01:57.050
If that is how it develops,

00:01:57.050 --> 00:01:59.686
that's a felony in New York, Wolf.

00:01:59.686 --> 00:02:01.154
And it's a serious matter

00:02:01.154 --> 00:02:02.222
given the closeness

00:02:02.222 --> 00:02:04.157
of the 2016 election,

00:02:04.157 --> 00:02:06.359
a serious democracy matter.

00:02:06.626 --> 00:02:07.694
So he should expect

00:02:07.694 --> 00:02:09.529
to be treated accordingly.

00:02:09.529 --> 00:02:10.130
He'll be treated

00:02:10.130 --> 00:02:11.498
like any American citizen

00:02:11.498 --> 00:02:13.666
if he's formally criminally charged

00:02:13.666 --> 00:02:14.467
with an indictment.

00:02:14.467 --> 00:02:15.168
Maggie Haberman,

00:02:15.168 --> 00:02:16.202
let me get your

00:02:16.202 --> 00:02:16.870
your thoughts

00:02:16.870 --> 00:02:18.338
I know you got to run soon,

00:02:18.338 --> 00:02:19.806
but tell me what else

00:02:19.806 --> 00:02:22.742
Trump will be doing as we anticipate this

00:02:22.742 --> 00:02:24.844
these charges will be presented to him

00:02:24.844 --> 00:02:25.912
very, very soon.

00:02:27.046 --> 00:02:27.447
Sure.

00:02:27.447 --> 00:02:28.014
Wolf, they're still

00:02:28.014 --> 00:02:30.083
digesting the news down at Mar a Lago.

00:02:30.550 --> 00:02:32.485
They really were caught very much

00:02:32.485 --> 00:02:33.720
by surprise

00:02:33.720 --> 00:02:34.854
by the fact of this happening.

00:02:34.854 --> 00:02:35.989
I can't stress that enough.

00:02:35.989 --> 00:02:37.490
Now, will come the

00:02:37.490 --> 00:02:37.891
you know,

00:02:37.891 --> 00:02:38.925
the delicate arrangements

00:02:38.925 --> 00:02:40.793
around a surrender,

00:02:40.793 --> 00:02:42.729
which, you know, Trump's

00:02:42.729 --> 00:02:43.263
lawyer, Joe

00:02:43.263 --> 00:02:44.864
Tacopina, said he is going to do it

00:02:44.864 --> 00:02:45.832
willingly.

00:02:45.832 --> 00:02:47.033
We have heard that from other people

00:02:47.033 --> 00:02:47.834
around him as well.

00:02:47.834 --> 00:02:48.334
With Trump,

00:02:48.334 --> 00:02:50.103
you obviously never know

00:02:50.103 --> 00:02:51.371
surrender in any form.

00:02:51.371 --> 00:02:51.938
It's not something

00:02:51.938 --> 00:02:53.006
Donald Trump likes to do,

00:02:53.006 --> 00:02:54.741
I think, let alone this one.

00:02:54.741 --> 00:02:56.676
But that is where we are going to

00:02:56.676 --> 00:02:58.111
go with this next.

00:02:58.111 --> 00:02:58.611
And that will,

00:02:58.611 --> 00:03:00.780
I suspect, happen in the coming days.

00:03:00.780 --> 00:03:01.881
And I think Trump will,

00:03:01.881 --> 00:03:03.616
you know, try to use the weekend

00:03:03.616 --> 00:03:04.684
to sway public opinion

00:03:04.684 --> 00:03:05.552
as much as possible.

00:03:05.552 --> 00:03:07.153
That's his go to move, Wolf.

00:03:07.153 --> 00:03:07.787
It has always been

00:03:07.787 --> 00:03:08.721
his goal to move

00:03:08.721 --> 00:03:10.290
is to try to shape public opinion

00:03:10.290 --> 00:03:11.724
and use that, of course, events.

00:03:11.724 --> 00:03:12.625
He was trying it

00:03:12.625 --> 00:03:13.393
with what was essentially

00:03:13.393 --> 00:03:14.460
an intimidation campaign

00:03:14.460 --> 00:03:15.995
against Alvin Bragg

00:03:15.995 --> 00:03:17.764
in the last two weeks.

00:03:17.764 --> 00:03:19.399
It clearly did not work.

00:03:19.399 --> 00:03:20.700
Certainly did not work.

00:03:20.700 --> 00:03:21.668
This indictment

00:03:21.668 --> 00:03:23.069
about to be formally presented

00:03:23.069 --> 00:03:24.671
to the former president

00:03:24.671 --> 00:03:25.572
of the United States.

00:03:25.572 --> 00:03:27.240
And you're in New York, Maggie.

00:03:27.240 --> 00:03:27.740
I take it

00:03:27.740 --> 00:03:29.943
security has been beefed up dramatically

00:03:30.109 --> 00:03:31.444
over these past several days.

00:03:32.612 --> 00:03:33.813
Well, security

00:03:33.813 --> 00:03:35.215
had been beefed up

00:03:35.215 --> 00:03:36.115
and then it seemed

00:03:36.115 --> 00:03:37.951
as if it had receded a bit.

00:03:37.951 --> 00:03:40.720
I there were some reports a little bit

00:03:40.720 --> 00:03:41.721
earlier today

00:03:41.721 --> 00:03:42.722
that there might have been

00:03:42.722 --> 00:03:43.856
some increase happening.

00:03:43.856 --> 00:03:44.624
I certainly expect

00:03:44.624 --> 00:03:46.192
if it has not happened already.

00:03:46.192 --> 00:03:47.860
It will in the coming days,

00:03:47.860 --> 00:03:48.695
because nobody knows

00:03:48.695 --> 00:03:49.829
how this is going to play out.

00:03:49.829 --> 00:03:51.397
I will note that,

00:03:51.397 --> 00:03:52.065
you know, Trump

00:03:52.065 --> 00:03:54.300
previously called on his supporters

00:03:54.567 --> 00:03:55.368
to protest,

00:03:55.368 --> 00:03:56.502
you know, Take Our Nation

00:03:56.502 --> 00:03:58.871
Back was the quote that he put on social.

00:03:59.138 --> 00:04:00.807
Very few people showed up to protest

00:04:00.807 --> 00:04:02.342
because very few people,

00:04:02.342 --> 00:04:03.209
you know, wanted to

00:04:03.209 --> 00:04:04.344
to do anything

00:04:04.344 --> 00:04:05.778
to jeopardize themselves,

00:04:05.778 --> 00:04:06.913
especially after the January

00:04:06.913 --> 00:04:08.381
six attack on the Capitol.

00:04:08.381 --> 00:04:09.482
That could change

00:04:09.482 --> 00:04:11.784
with the actuality of an indictment.

00:04:11.818 --> 00:04:12.085
That's what

00:04:12.085 --> 00:04:13.353
a lot of this has depended on,

00:04:13.353 --> 00:04:14.787
because Trump's supporters

00:04:14.787 --> 00:04:16.756
have heard so many times for the last,

00:04:16.756 --> 00:04:18.124
you know, six years

00:04:18.124 --> 00:04:19.192
that he was in trouble

00:04:19.192 --> 00:04:20.460
and then he wasn't.

00:04:20.460 --> 00:04:21.561
I think that this just didn't

00:04:21.561 --> 00:04:22.562
feel like a reality.

00:04:22.562 --> 00:04:23.997
And we'll see if now it does.

00:04:23.997 --> 00:04:25.231
You've covered Trump for years.

00:04:25.231 --> 00:04:26.733
Imagine you know him well.

00:04:26.733 --> 00:04:27.900
How much is this bruise?

00:04:27.900 --> 00:04:28.568
Is ego

00:04:28.568 --> 00:04:30.870
especially unfolding in his backyard

00:04:31.070 --> 00:04:31.771
of Manhattan

00:04:33.306 --> 00:04:34.507
I think two things, Wolf.

00:04:34.507 --> 00:04:35.942
I think there's no question that,

00:04:35.942 --> 00:04:36.342
you know, for

00:04:36.342 --> 00:04:38.411
somebody who made his bones in this city,

00:04:38.645 --> 00:04:40.947
his image, you know, was was built

00:04:40.947 --> 00:04:41.914
brick by brick.

00:04:41.914 --> 00:04:43.883
Of news stories in this city.

00:04:43.883 --> 00:04:45.184
He considered Robert

00:04:45.184 --> 00:04:46.519
Morgenthau, one of Alan Brags,

00:04:46.519 --> 00:04:48.221
predecessors, a personal friend.

00:04:48.221 --> 00:04:49.922
He was very clear about that

00:04:49.922 --> 00:04:50.723
with me in an interview

00:04:50.723 --> 00:04:51.691
that I did with him for a book

00:04:51.691 --> 00:04:52.759
I wrote about him.

00:04:52.759 --> 00:04:54.294
I think this has a very

00:04:54.294 --> 00:04:55.495
significant effect.

00:04:55.495 --> 00:04:56.596
I also think that, you know,

00:04:56.596 --> 00:04:58.931
he was very, very

00:04:58.931 --> 00:04:59.899
he was horrified,

00:04:59.899 --> 00:05:01.000
for lack of a better word,

00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:03.036
watching Allen Weisselberg,

00:05:03.303 --> 00:05:04.671
his former chief financial officer

00:05:04.671 --> 00:05:05.972
at the Trump Organization,

00:05:05.972 --> 00:05:07.974
taken away by officers

00:05:07.974 --> 00:05:09.642
when he surrendered when he was indicted.

00:05:09.642 --> 00:05:10.810
20. 21.

00:05:10.810 --> 00:05:11.844
And you know, Allen

00:05:11.844 --> 00:05:13.513
Weisselberg is about Trump's age,

00:05:13.513 --> 00:05:14.180
I think a little bit

00:05:14.180 --> 00:05:15.415
a little bit younger.

00:05:15.415 --> 00:05:17.317
And Trump is not looking forward to this.

00:05:17.317 --> 00:05:19.118
I think there is a real world

00:05:19.118 --> 00:05:19.852
effect here.

00:05:19.852 --> 00:05:21.688
And then there is the internal effect

00:05:21.688 --> 00:05:22.322
Yeah.

00:05:22.322 --> 00:05:24.390
Well, can I just add to that, that moment

00:05:24.390 --> 00:05:24.791
with Allen

00:05:24.791 --> 00:05:25.825
Weisselberg is something

00:05:25.825 --> 00:05:26.926
that Trump has brought up

00:05:26.926 --> 00:05:28.928
repeatedly in private,

00:05:28.928 --> 00:05:30.330
noting the fact that it was someone

00:05:30.330 --> 00:05:32.031
that he had known and worked with

00:05:32.031 --> 00:05:32.732
for such a long

00:05:32.732 --> 00:05:34.400
time, was part of his organization

00:05:34.400 --> 00:05:35.268
for such a long time.

00:05:35.268 --> 00:05:36.969
They had a storied history together,

00:05:36.969 --> 00:05:38.805
and to watch what happened to him,

00:05:38.805 --> 00:05:40.206
I think, really shook Trump.

00:05:40.206 --> 00:05:40.440
I mean,

00:05:40.440 --> 00:05:41.307
he often brought it

00:05:41.307 --> 00:05:43.076
up, still brings it up to this day,

00:05:43.076 --> 00:05:44.977
not just publicly on social,

00:05:44.977 --> 00:05:46.412
but at dinners and private dinners

00:05:46.412 --> 00:05:48.214
with friends and private conversations.

00:05:48.214 --> 00:05:48.581
Thompson

00:05:48.581 --> 00:05:50.249
talking about his own investigation.

00:05:50.249 --> 00:05:51.184
So it is a moment

00:05:51.184 --> 00:05:52.352
that actually shook him.

00:05:52.352 --> 00:05:53.486
And I do think that is something

00:05:53.486 --> 00:05:54.587
that he has been considering

00:05:54.587 --> 00:05:56.589
and thinking about in recent weeks

00:05:56.589 --> 00:05:57.990
as this has become

00:05:57.990 --> 00:05:59.592
a very real reality for him,

00:05:59.592 --> 00:06:00.793
that this is also something

00:06:00.793 --> 00:06:02.428
that could likely to happen to him,

00:06:02.428 --> 00:06:03.129
that this arrest,

00:06:03.129 --> 00:06:04.230
this indictment is something

00:06:04.230 --> 00:06:05.732
that was in his future

00:06:05.732 --> 00:06:07.967
and they were bracing for it last week.

00:06:07.967 --> 00:06:08.901
They kind of

00:06:08.901 --> 00:06:09.969
had been under this impression

00:06:09.969 --> 00:06:11.471
done at Mar a Lago that it could happen

00:06:11.471 --> 00:06:12.271
any moment.

00:06:12.271 --> 00:06:13.673
They were making the preparations

00:06:13.673 --> 00:06:14.841
for what that would look like.

00:06:14.841 --> 00:06:16.075
It seemed to hit a lull.

00:06:16.075 --> 00:06:16.776
And Trump

00:06:16.776 --> 00:06:17.844
has this idea

00:06:17.844 --> 00:06:19.979
sometimes that if he goes and speaks

00:06:19.979 --> 00:06:21.881
or if he speaks publicly about something,

00:06:21.881 --> 00:06:23.883
that he can bend things toward his will.

00:06:23.883 --> 00:06:24.817
I think you saw that

00:06:24.817 --> 00:06:26.419
at his rally in Waco, Texas,

00:06:26.419 --> 00:06:26.853
as he spent

00:06:26.853 --> 00:06:28.020
a large chunk of time

00:06:28.020 --> 00:06:30.022
talking about these investigations

00:06:30.022 --> 00:06:31.357
and talking about how he believes he's

00:06:31.357 --> 00:06:32.759
been treated unfairly.

00:06:32.759 --> 00:06:33.893
He even briefly entertained

00:06:33.893 --> 00:06:34.694
the idea of going

00:06:34.694 --> 00:06:35.661
before the grand jury,

00:06:35.661 --> 00:06:37.296
something that no attorney

00:06:37.296 --> 00:06:38.865
would recommend for their client,

00:06:38.865 --> 00:06:40.533
because he does have this idea

00:06:40.533 --> 00:06:42.402
that he can shape people's opinions

00:06:42.402 --> 00:06:44.103
and change their views on things.

00:06:44.103 --> 00:06:46.239
Obviously, that has not happened here.

00:06:46.239 --> 00:06:47.206
And there are big questions

00:06:47.206 --> 00:06:47.974
about what the

00:06:47.974 --> 00:06:49.442
this case actually looks like.

00:06:49.442 --> 00:06:50.209
Going forward.

00:06:50.209 --> 00:06:51.811
It's not a slam dunk, as you've heard

00:06:51.811 --> 00:06:53.413
from many legal experts.

00:06:53.413 --> 00:06:54.180
But the idea that

00:06:54.180 --> 00:06:55.348
this is actually happening,

00:06:55.348 --> 00:06:55.982
I think, is something

00:06:55.982 --> 00:06:57.483
that they had tried to push off

00:06:57.483 --> 00:06:59.051
for as long as possible.

00:06:59.051 --> 00:06:59.285
You know,

00:06:59.285 --> 00:07:00.720
they tried and tried and tried,

00:07:00.720 --> 00:07:02.722
but they clearly now have failed.

00:07:02.722 --> 00:07:04.056
This criminal indictment

00:07:04.056 --> 00:07:06.159
is about to be presented to Trump

00:07:06.159 --> 00:07:08.227
and the legal process will move

00:07:08.461 --> 00:07:10.863
forward very, very serious

00:07:10.863 --> 00:07:12.131
developments as well.

00:07:12.131 --> 00:07:14.400
Sean, Will, you're a former prosecutor.

00:07:14.400 --> 00:07:15.301
Walk us through

00:07:15.301 --> 00:07:16.769
what Trump should now expect

00:07:19.505 --> 00:07:20.540
Well, not to expect

00:07:20.540 --> 00:07:21.007
that his

00:07:21.007 --> 00:07:22.341
lawyers are going to have to arrange

00:07:22.341 --> 00:07:24.310
for him to do a self surrender.

00:07:24.310 --> 00:07:25.044
And this question

00:07:25.044 --> 00:07:27.713
of whether he does a big publicity stunt,

00:07:27.713 --> 00:07:28.881
will they perp walk?

00:07:28.881 --> 00:07:29.482
That's something

00:07:29.482 --> 00:07:30.450
that they'll have to work out

00:07:30.450 --> 00:07:30.783
a little bit.

00:07:30.783 --> 00:07:31.417
I don't think that's going

00:07:31.417 --> 00:07:32.852
to be completely in his control.

00:07:32.852 --> 00:07:33.719
It's going to be between

00:07:33.719 --> 00:07:34.954
the DA's

00:07:34.954 --> 00:07:35.888
Secret Service,

00:07:35.888 --> 00:07:37.590
New York Police Department.

00:07:37.590 --> 00:07:38.958
I just want to say, you know, what

00:07:38.958 --> 00:07:40.626
Caitlin was pointing out about him being

00:07:40.626 --> 00:07:42.061
so affected by Weisselberg,

00:07:42.061 --> 00:07:43.262
I just find it interesting.

00:07:43.262 --> 00:07:44.897
He didn't seem to be so moved

00:07:44.897 --> 00:07:46.399
or pained by Michael Cohen

00:07:46.399 --> 00:07:47.934
actually going to jail.

00:07:47.934 --> 00:07:49.669
For this very crime.

00:07:49.669 --> 00:07:50.703
And it's Cohen

00:07:50.703 --> 00:07:52.638
now is going to be a central witness

